{"id":"1f67ebee-0713-4d81-b2a5-6fa34b7061c6","revision":0,"last_node_id":22,"last_link_id":25,"nodes":[{"id":1,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[100,-520],"size":[1420,420],"flags":{},"order":0,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"⚡ Guide: Viggle Turbo 6-Step 360° Viewpoint Orbit","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"MarkdownNote"},"widgets_values":["# 🌀 Qwen-Image-2.1 Viewpoint Orbit 360° Turntable\n\n### 🎯 3 Seamless Operating Modes:\n1. **Full Turntable 360** (Default):\n   - Generates all **8 unified views** in sequence (0° front via `keep angle`, 45° R, 90° R, 135° R, 180°, 135° L, 90° L, 45° L).\n   - Saved automatically to the active 8-frame session buffer.\n2. **Patch Single Frame** (Surgical Replacement):\n   - Select any angle from `camera_angle` (e.g. `180` or `90 right`).\n   - Generates **only that 1 frame** and surgically updates that exact slot in the 8-view turntable!\n   - You don't have to re-render all 8 frames if just one angle needs improvement!\n3. **Single View** (Standalone):\n   - Generates 1 independent camera angle without buffering.\n\n### 🎥 Media Export & Interactive Scrubbing:\n- **Interactive Viewer**: Drag the 📷 camera handle along the orbit ring, click playback presets (0.5x, 1x, 2x), or click any thumbnail.\n- **Export Node**: Looping MP4 (H.264), animated WEBP, and individual alpha PNG frames.\n"],"widgets_values_named":{"text":"# 🌀 Qwen-Image-2.1 Viewpoint Orbit 360° Turntable\n\n### 🎯 3 Seamless Operating Modes:\n1. **Full Turntable 360** (Default):\n   - Generates all **8 unified views** in sequence (0° front via `keep angle`, 45° R, 90° R, 135° R, 180°, 135° L, 90° L, 45° L).\n   - Saved automatically to the active 8-frame session buffer.\n2. **Patch Single Frame** (Surgical Replacement):\n   - Select any angle from `camera_angle` (e.g. `180` or `90 right`).\n   - Generates **only that 1 frame** and surgically updates that exact slot in the 8-view turntable!\n   - You don't have to re-render all 8 frames if just one angle needs 